WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,950
Unexpectedly, King Su Qin

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:03,950
How could he come up with such an idea?

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,670
If you agree

4
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:07,510
In the future, I will be the emperor

5
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:10,220
What more dignity is there, Your Majesty?

6
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,620
This matter is big

7
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,420
I think I should let the two envoys

8
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,620
Go to Hongyu Temple first

9
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:15,900
wait a while

10
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,020
Let’s negotiate with Northern Alliance again

11
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,300
negotiate something

12
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,220
what does it mean

13
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,260
Do you still have to wait?

14
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,060
We have been waiting for more than seven days

15
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,100
This matter cannot be resolved in a day

16
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,980
Is it better to ask the two envoys to wait a little longer?

17
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,780
His Majesty the Emperor of Chu

18
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:37,720
Then we'll wait for the emperor's uncle

19
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:38,960
What did you mean just now?

20
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:41,520
I am just giving your Majesty a suggestion.

21
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,040
As for whether to do or not to do

22
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:46,410
It's all up to Your Majesty

23
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,700
It is absolutely impossible to be related to him

24
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:52,060
I, the great Chu, use all my strength to conceal it from the north

25
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,940
This is the way to marry and die
